WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:03.440
Please invite the Yan Dong envoy to the court.

00:09.800 --> 00:11.200
Greetings, Your Majesty.

00:12.200 --> 00:13.600
Envoy, please rise.

00:17.400 --> 00:23.160
Your Majesty for decades our Yan Dong court has still held Xuan Kingdom's credentials.

00:23.280 --> 00:28.520
And considers itself a vassal state of Xuan now my father has sent me hoping even more.

00:28.680 --> 00:34.400
To be able to restore our former friendship with Your Majesty we are willing to offer ten thousand fine horses.

00:34.480 --> 00:39.520
To marry a princess as queen from then on with Great Xuan.

00:39.640 --> 00:44.040
We will work together in harmony sharing the same spirit and connected branches.

00:47.240 --> 00:50.680
This proposal I will consider it.

00:51.920 --> 00:56.480
The Yan Dong envoy has come from afar after a long journey please.

00:56.560 --> 00:58.400
Return early to rest.

00:58.960 --> 01:00.360
Thank you, Your Majesty.

01:05.440 --> 01:11.040
Excellent yan Dong is willing to help us attack Wuzhao but they want to marry a princess.

01:11.160 --> 01:13.680
Isn't there only Princess Xunyang in the palace?

01:13.760 --> 01:19.547
Right just marry Princess Xunyang off to them alright let's discuss the next matter.

01:27.560 --> 01:32.960
Your Majesty lady Liu is still kneeling outside we can't persuade her to leave.

02:07.200 --> 02:08.600
Your Majesty.

02:10.400 --> 02:14.920
When you were in Yiyang, you promised Grandfather to protect me.

02:15.000 --> 02:19.160
In peace and happiness for life I want nothing.

02:19.520 --> 02:21.853
I beg you, don't let Yu'er leave.

02:33.520 --> 02:34.920
Rise first.

02:51.680 --> 02:56.960
Your Majesty don't let Yu'er leave I beg you.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.680
Listen to me.

03:06.400 --> 03:08.067
Return to the palace first.

03:24.000 --> 03:30.000
Father yan Dong has also been harassed by Wuzhao for years Your son believes if the two states can form a marriage alliance.

03:30.080 --> 03:35.200
To watch over each other and together drive out Wuzhao would be the best strategy Sikong Sheng.

03:35.280 --> 03:39.960
You're a coward that's your sister how can you let her marry to a place like Yan Dong.

03:40.040 --> 03:43.400
A remote and poor place to suffer with Yan Dong's assistance.

03:43.480 --> 03:48.920
How many fewer of our people would die to let my sister marry far away how could I not be heartbroken.

03:49.000 --> 03:53.267
But as members of the royal family why not bear the responsibility for the people.

03:54.120 --> 03:57.920
Do you think the people kneel to you kneel to me kneel to Princess Xunyang.

04:00.680 --> 04:05.000
Father if the state and realm must rely on Yu'er, a mere woman to bring stability and revival.

04:05.080 --> 04:11.000
Then what use are all the men in court Father Your son is willing to be the vanguard on the day of the northern expedition.

04:11.120 --> 04:12.520
To defeat Wuzhao.

04:14.320 --> 04:19.120
Father's lifelong efforts have all been for reviving Great Xuan you are the father of all under heaven.

04:19.200 --> 04:21.880
Should not be limited to one family by personal affections.

04:23.880 --> 04:28.427
All rise I will make my own decision.

04:48.080 --> 04:52.200
Your Majesty the Ministry of Rites just sent someone to ask again.

04:52.280 --> 04:56.787
Only a few days left before the envoy returns we must have an answer.

04:57.600 --> 05:02.480
Before I asked you to sound her out to ask Xunyang's thoughts.

05:04.120 --> 05:08.747
The princess cares for Your Majesty this servant sees she is willing to go.

05:10.440 --> 05:13.680
She said nothing else this.

05:14.520 --> 05:18.787
To leave home thousands of miles away sorrow is inevitable but Princess Xunyang is filial.

05:19.080 --> 05:21.720
She would never go against Your Majesty's wishes.

